OL,3,GNEWSABan on fridge and freezer
OL,4,Arecycling collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA national backlog in the safe disposal
OL,7,Fof fridges and freezers has led to some
OL,8,Fcouncils refusing to collect them as
OL,9,Fpart of their bulky waste service.
OL,11,FSouth Oxfordshire and the Vale of White
OL,12,FHorse district councils said they have
OL,13,Fbeen asked by the county council to
OL,14,Fstop picking them up.
OL,16,FIt follows a similar move by Cherwell
OL,17,FDistrict Council, after disruption at
OL,18,Fspecialist recycling centres across the
OL,19,Fcountry.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
