OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABan on fridge and freezer
OL,4,Arecycling collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for South Oxfordshire
OL,7,Fand Vale of White Horse District
OL,8,FCouncils said they will monitor the
OL,9,Fsituation, "including any potential
OL,10,Fimpact on fly-tipping" and will review
OL,11,Fcollections "as soon as processing
OL,12,Fcapacity becomes available".
